      "links": [],
      "position": 8554.78125,
      "record_id": "XDubdgt4BoU2gTx6SKYcoRTlnBg",
      "text": "阶段三：最终输出",
      "type": "block docx-heading4-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "169",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "position": 8587.96875,
      "record_id": "Uie1d2NvWoHMTUxQTnrcre8rnZf",
      "text": "",
      "type": "block docx-text-block isEmpty"
    },
    {
      "id": "170",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "position": 8629.96875,
      "record_id": "XfMwdtg6dor4mExvp0NcMYL2nJd",
      "text": "\n代码块\nPython\n复制\n# 构建最终输出 Prompt\nmessages = _build_final_messages(state)\n\n# 流式生成自然语言回复\nfor chunk in stream_llm(messages):\n    yield chunk\n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
